// Count of kept winning labeled hammings not equal to the lower central value.
// An empty difference set returns -1, not 0. This count is never 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE lxcn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG lxcn rank

IMPULSE lxcn 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lxcn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
